            <title>2.4</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 17:51:58 +0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://inoon.app/</link>
            <sparkle:version>37</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.6</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="plain-text">New: Folder Sync

Sync Mac folders with compatible app folders on your iPhone or iPad.

- Choose add-and-update, one-way mirror or two-way sync.
- Use USB or Wi-Fi, reserving larger transfers for USB.
- Sync automatically on Mac folder changes and device reconnection, or manually with Sync Now.

iNoon must remain open. Mirror mode deletes extra destination files.

Plus bug fixes and AI language improvements.
</description>
